{"duration": 75.68, "speech_start": 0.09, "speech_end": 75.27, "timing_mode": "pauses", "sentences": [{"text": "A while back, a Ugandan pastor said marriage isn't a must for ministers.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s1", "start": 0.09, "end": 4.63, "pause_after": 0.31, "words": [{"n": "a", "t0": 0.09, "t1": 0.14}, {"n": "while", "t0": 0.191, "t1": 0.443}, {"n": "back", "t0": 0.493, "t1": 1.045}, {"n": "a", "t0": 1.096, "t1": 1.146}, {"n": "ugandan", "t0": 1.197, "t1": 1.55}, {"n": "pastor", "t0": 1.6, "t1": 1.903}, {"n": "said", "t0": 1.953, "t1": 2.155}, {"n": "marriage", "t0": 2.205, "t1": 2.608}, {"n": "isn't", "t0": 2.659, "t1": 2.911}, {"n": "a", "t0": 2.961, "t1": 3.012}, {"n": "must", "t0": 3.062, "t1": 3.264}, {"n": "for", "t0": 3.314, "t1": 3.465}, {"n": "ministers", "t0": 3.516, "t1": 4.02}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Singleness, he argued, offers self-discovery and spiritual maturity — and the church should stop pressuring pastors to marry.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s2", "start": 4.94, "end": 12.69, "pause_after": 0.77, "words": [{"n": "singleness", "t0": 4.94, "t1": 5.778}, {"n": "he", "t0": 5.831, "t1": 5.936}, {"n": "argued", "t0": 5.988, "t1": 6.686}, {"n": "offers", "t0": 6.739, "t1": 7.054}, {"n": "self-discovery", "t0": 7.107, "t1": 7.843}, {"n": "and", "t0": 7.895, "t1": 8.053}, {"n": "spiritual", "t0": 8.105, "t1": 8.578}, {"n": "maturity", "t0": 8.631, "t1": 9.322}, {"n": "and", "t0": 9.799, "t1": 9.957}, {"n": "the", "t0": 10.009, "t1": 10.167}, {"n": "church", "t0": 10.22, "t1": 10.535}, {"n": "should", "t0": 10.588, "t1": 10.903}, {"n": "stop", "t0": 10.956, "t1": 11.166}, {"n": "pressuring", "t0": 11.218, "t1": 11.744}, {"n": "pastors", "t0": 11.796, "t1": 12.164}, {"n": "to", "t0": 12.217, "t1": 12.322}, {"n": "marry", "t0": 12.375, "t1": 12.69}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "I disagree — with a qualifier.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s3", "start": 13.46, "end": 15.25, "pause_after": 0.31, "words": [{"n": "i", "t0": 13.46, "t1": 13.509}, {"n": "disagree", "t0": 13.559, "t1": 13.953}, {"n": "with", "t0": 14.411, "t1": 14.609}, {"n": "a", "t0": 14.658, "t1": 14.707}, {"n": "qualifier", "t0": 14.757, "t1": 15.25}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Is your single pastor automatically a problem?", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s4", "start": 15.56, "end": 17.73, "pause_after": 0.31, "words": [{"n": "is", "t0": 15.56, "t1": 15.654}, {"n": "your", "t0": 15.702, "t1": 15.89}, {"n": "single", "t0": 15.937, "t1": 16.22}, {"n": "pastor", "t0": 16.268, "t1": 16.551}, {"n": "automatically", "t0": 16.598, "t1": 17.211}, {"n": "a", "t0": 17.258, "t1": 17.305}, {"n": "problem", "t0": 17.353, "t1": 17.73}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "No.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s5", "start": 18.04, "end": 18.24, "pause_after": 0.34, "words": [{"n": "no", "t0": 18.04, "t1": 18.24}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Probably a problem?", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s6", "start": 18.58, "end": 19.44, "pause_after": 0.29, "words": [{"n": "probably", "t0": 18.58, "t1": 18.942}, {"n": "a", "t0": 18.987, "t1": 19.033}, {"n": "problem", "t0": 19.078, "t1": 19.44}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Yes.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s7", "start": 19.73, "end": 20.05, "pause_after": 0.3, "words": [{"n": "yes", "t0": 19.73, "t1": 20.05}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "The question isn't whether a single man can be godly or fruitful.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s8", "start": 20.35, "end": 23.76, "pause_after": 0.81, "words": [{"n": "the", "t0": 20.35, "t1": 20.507}, {"n": "question", "t0": 20.56, "t1": 20.98}, {"n": "isn't", "t0": 21.032, "t1": 21.294}, {"n": "whether", "t0": 21.347, "t1": 21.714}, {"n": "a", "t0": 21.766, "t1": 21.819}, {"n": "single", "t0": 21.871, "t1": 22.186}, {"n": "man", "t0": 22.239, "t1": 22.396}, {"n": "can", "t0": 22.448, "t1": 22.606}, {"n": "be", "t0": 22.658, "t1": 22.763}, {"n": "godly", "t0": 22.816, "t1": 23.078}, {"n": "or", "t0": 23.13, "t1": 23.235}, {"n": "fruitful", "t0": 23.288, "t1": 23.76}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "It's what the apostles expected when they described the man fit to pastor.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s9", "start": 24.57, "end": 28.46, "pause_after": 0.38, "words": [{"n": "it's", "t0": 24.57, "t1": 24.761}, {"n": "what", "t0": 24.809, "t1": 24.999}, {"n": "the", "t0": 25.047, "t1": 25.19}, {"n": "apostles", "t0": 25.238, "t1": 25.619}, {"n": "expected", "t0": 25.667, "t1": 26.049}, {"n": "when", "t0": 26.096, "t1": 26.287}, {"n": "they", "t0": 26.335, "t1": 26.526}, {"n": "described", "t0": 26.574, "t1": 27.003}, {"n": "the", "t0": 27.051, "t1": 27.194}, {"n": "man", "t0": 27.241, "t1": 27.384}, {"n": "fit", "t0": 27.432, "t1": 27.575}, {"n": "to", "t0": 27.623, "t1": 27.718}, {"n": "pastor", "t0": 27.766, "t1": 28.1}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Paul says a pastor must be \"a one-woman man\" — that's about character, not a marriage certificate.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s10", "start": 28.84, "end": 34.46, "pause_after": 0.7, "words": [{"n": "paul", "t0": 28.84, "t1": 29.018}, {"n": "says", "t0": 29.062, "t1": 29.24}, {"n": "a", "t0": 29.285, "t1": 29.329}, {"n": "pastor", "t0": 29.374, "t1": 29.641}, {"n": "must", "t0": 29.685, "t1": 29.863}, {"n": "be", "t0": 29.908, "t1": 29.997}, {"n": "a", "t0": 30.041, "t1": 30.13}, {"n": "one-woman", "t0": 30.175, "t1": 30.575}, {"n": "man", "t0": 30.62, "t1": 31.088}, {"n": "that's", "t0": 31.561, "t1": 31.828}, {"n": "about", "t0": 31.872, "t1": 32.095}, {"n": "character", "t0": 32.139, "t1": 32.934}, {"n": "not", "t0": 32.979, "t1": 33.112}, {"n": "a", "t0": 33.157, "t1": 33.201}, {"n": "marriage", "t0": 33.246, "t1": 33.602}, {"n": "certificate", "t0": 33.646, "t1": 34.18}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "But he immediately adds that a pastor must manage his own household well — because if he can't run his family, how will he care for God's church?", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s11", "start": 35.16, "end": 42.73, "pause_after": 0.35, "words": [{"n": "but", "t0": 35.16, "t1": 35.294}, {"n": "he", "t0": 35.339, "t1": 35.428}, {"n": "immediately", "t0": 35.473, "t1": 35.964}, {"n": "adds", "t0": 36.009, "t1": 36.188}, {"n": "that", "t0": 36.233, "t1": 36.411}, {"n": "a", "t0": 36.456, "t1": 36.501}, {"n": "pastor", "t0": 36.545, "t1": 36.814}, {"n": "must", "t0": 36.858, "t1": 37.037}, {"n": "manage", "t0": 37.082, "t1": 37.35}, {"n": "his", "t0": 37.394, "t1": 37.529}, {"n": "own", "t0": 37.573, "t1": 37.707}, {"n": "household", "t0": 37.752, "t1": 38.154}, {"n": "well", "t0": 38.199, "t1": 38.688}, {"n": "because", "t0": 39.262, "t1": 39.575}, {"n": "if", "t0": 39.619, "t1": 39.709}, {"n": "he", "t0": 39.753, "t1": 39.843}, {"n": "can't", "t0": 39.887, "t1": 40.111}, {"n": "run", "t0": 40.156, "t1": 40.29}, {"n": "his", "t0": 40.334, "t1": 40.468}, {"n": "family", "t0": 40.513, "t1": 41.166}, {"n": "how", "t0": 41.211, "t1": 41.345}, {"n": "will", "t0": 41.389, "t1": 41.568}, {"n": "he", "t0": 41.613, "t1": 41.702}, {"n": "care", "t0": 41.747, "t1": 41.926}, {"n": "for", "t0": 41.97, "t1": 42.104}, {"n": "god's", "t0": 42.149, "t1": 42.372}, {"n": "church", "t0": 42.417, "t1": 42.73}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "The household is God's proving ground for shepherds.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s12", "start": 43.08, "end": 46.02, "pause_after": 0.65, "words": [{"n": "the", "t0": 43.08, "t1": 43.212}, {"n": "household", "t0": 43.255, "t1": 43.65}, {"n": "is", "t0": 43.694, "t1": 43.782}, {"n": "god's", "t0": 43.825, "t1": 44.045}, {"n": "proving", "t0": 44.088, "t1": 44.395}, {"n": "ground", "t0": 44.439, "t1": 44.702}, {"n": "for", "t0": 44.746, "t1": 44.878}, {"n": "shepherds", "t0": 44.922, "t1": 45.36}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "So marriage isn't a magic checkbox.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s13", "start": 46.67, "end": 48.84, "pause_after": 0.28, "words": [{"n": "so", "t0": 46.67, "t1": 46.778}, {"n": "marriage", "t0": 46.832, "t1": 47.264}, {"n": "isn't", "t0": 47.318, "t1": 47.588}, {"n": "a", "t0": 47.642, "t1": 47.696}, {"n": "magic", "t0": 47.75, "t1": 48.02}, {"n": "checkbox", "t0": 48.074, "t1": 48.56}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "It's the ordinary training ground.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s14", "start": 49.12, "end": 50.62, "pause_after": 0.35, "words": [{"n": "it's", "t0": 49.12, "t1": 49.296}, {"n": "the", "t0": 49.341, "t1": 49.473}, {"n": "ordinary", "t0": 49.517, "t1": 49.87}, {"n": "training", "t0": 49.914, "t1": 50.267}, {"n": "ground", "t0": 50.311, "t1": 50.62}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "That's why the single candidate should be the outlier — the burden of proof is on him.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s15", "start": 50.97, "end": 56.67, "pause_after": 0.78, "words": [{"n": "that's", "t0": 50.97, "t1": 51.271}, {"n": "why", "t0": 51.321, "t1": 51.471}, {"n": "the", "t0": 51.521, "t1": 51.672}, {"n": "single", "t0": 51.722, "t1": 52.022}, {"n": "candidate", "t0": 52.073, "t1": 52.524}, {"n": "should", "t0": 52.574, "t1": 52.874}, {"n": "be", "t0": 52.925, "t1": 53.025}, {"n": "the", "t0": 53.075, "t1": 53.225}, {"n": "outlier", "t0": 53.275, "t1": 53.976}, {"n": "the", "t0": 54.507, "t1": 54.657}, {"n": "burden", "t0": 54.707, "t1": 55.008}, {"n": "of", "t0": 55.058, "t1": 55.158}, {"n": "proof", "t0": 55.208, "t1": 55.459}, {"n": "is", "t0": 55.509, "t1": 55.609}, {"n": "on", "t0": 55.659, "t1": 55.759}, {"n": "him", "t0": 55.81, "t1": 56.01}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "What about Paul?", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s16", "start": 57.45, "end": 58.07, "pause_after": 0.36, "words": [{"n": "what", "t0": 57.45, "t1": 57.605}, {"n": "about", "t0": 57.644, "t1": 57.837}, {"n": "paul", "t0": 57.876, "t1": 58.07}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "He was single — but he calls his celibacy a rare, extraordinary gift.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s17", "start": 58.43, "end": 61.9, "pause_after": 0.52, "words": [{"n": "he", "t0": 58.43, "t1": 58.512}, {"n": "was", "t0": 58.553, "t1": 58.677}, {"n": "single", "t0": 58.718, "t1": 58.965}, {"n": "but", "t0": 59.089, "t1": 59.212}, {"n": "he", "t0": 59.253, "t1": 59.336}, {"n": "calls", "t0": 59.377, "t1": 59.582}, {"n": "his", "t0": 59.624, "t1": 59.747}, {"n": "celibacy", "t0": 59.788, "t1": 60.118}, {"n": "a", "t0": 60.159, "t1": 60.2}, {"n": "rare", "t0": 60.241, "t1": 60.757}, {"n": "extraordinary", "t0": 60.798, "t1": 61.333}, {"n": "gift", "t0": 61.374, "t1": 61.58}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Luther said one in a thousand.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s18", "start": 62.42, "end": 64.2, "pause_after": 0.34, "words": [{"n": "luther", "t0": 62.42, "t1": 62.716}, {"n": "said", "t0": 62.765, "t1": 62.963}, {"n": "one", "t0": 63.012, "t1": 63.16}, {"n": "in", "t0": 63.209, "t1": 63.308}, {"n": "a", "t0": 63.357, "t1": 63.407}, {"n": "thousand", "t0": 63.456, "t1": 63.9}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "A single man burning with passion isn't gifted; he's a ticking time bomb.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s19", "start": 64.54, "end": 68.94, "pause_after": 0.69, "words": [{"n": "a", "t0": 64.54, "t1": 64.588}, {"n": "single", "t0": 64.636, "t1": 64.922}, {"n": "man", "t0": 64.97, "t1": 65.114}, {"n": "burning", "t0": 65.162, "t1": 65.496}, {"n": "with", "t0": 65.544, "t1": 65.735}, {"n": "passion", "t0": 65.783, "t1": 66.118}, {"n": "isn't", "t0": 66.165, "t1": 66.405}, {"n": "gifted", "t0": 66.452, "t1": 67.057}, {"n": "he's", "t0": 67.105, "t1": 67.296}, {"n": "a", "t0": 67.344, "t1": 67.392}, {"n": "ticking", "t0": 67.439, "t1": 67.774}, {"n": "time", "t0": 67.822, "t1": 68.013}, {"n": "bomb", "t0": 68.061, "t1": 68.3}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "So: character is the real qualification — but ordinarily, look for a husband and a father.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s20", "start": 69.63, "end": 75.27, "pause_after": 0.0, "words": [{"n": "so", "t0": 69.63, "t1": 70.088}, {"n": "character", "t0": 70.138, "t1": 70.583}, {"n": "is", "t0": 70.632, "t1": 70.731}, {"n": "the", "t0": 70.781, "t1": 70.929}, {"n": "real", "t0": 70.978, "t1": 71.176}, {"n": "qualification", "t0": 71.226, "t1": 71.868}, {"n": "but", "t0": 72.327, "t1": 72.475}, {"n": "ordinarily", "t0": 72.524, "t1": 73.348}, {"n": "look", "t0": 73.398, "t1": 73.596}, {"n": "for", "t0": 73.645, "t1": 73.793}, {"n": "a", "t0": 73.843, "t1": 73.892}, {"n": "husband", "t0": 73.942, "t1": 74.288}, {"n": "and", "t0": 74.337, "t1": 74.486}, {"n": "a", "t0": 74.535, "t1": 74.584}, {"n": "father", "t0": 74.634, "t1": 74.98}], "soft_cut": false}], "chapters": [{"from": "s1", "to": "s20", "id": "ch01", "start": 0.0, "end": 75.68}]}